"value":3,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=3657330","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3657320-1846651706692484","game_id":"steam-3657320","kind":"announcement","title":"Pelikeeper Demo 2.0 is LIVE for Steam Next Fest","summary":"Demo Version 2.0 is Lighting Up Steam Next Fest!It’s been a long journey to Steam Next Fest, and we’re finally here!!The whole team is super excited to share our work with players and show how much heart and passion we’ve been jamming into this little tower defense game. While we’ve been working on the full game, all our new ideas, content, and balance passes have also seeped into the first chunk of levels which you’ll find in the demo!New towers, art, music, sound effects, UI, characters, progr","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T19:44:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692484","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3657320-1833968530892559","game_id":"steam-3657320","kind":"announcement","title":"Pelikeeper Demo v1.2 is OUT NOW!!!","summary":"Hello Pelicans! We have a new update for the Pelikeeper demo that includes a bunch of new stuff:1.2 Patch NotesUpdated the waves for levels 1.0, 1.1, 1.2, 1.3 and the BossUpdated waves include new Fish School and Hermit Crab enemiesFish Schools spawn a group of small fish that travel down the path together and are each immune to piercing projectilesHermit Crab enemies will move down the path slowly and randomly stop to hide in their shell, becoming immune to damage for a short period of timeTota","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-29T23:52:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530892559","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3657320-1833334318569868","game_id":"steam-3657320","kind":"update","title":"Pelikeeper Demo Version 1.1 & Development Update","summary":"Hello Pelicans!Wow it's been over two months since the launch of the Pelikeeper demo, and we're a bit embarrassed that it's taken us this long to push another update.... but fret not! We are back in the swing of things and have a small(ish) update in preparation for our first large content update.Why isn't the game done it's been like foreverSo we've been pretty busy the last couple of months, not just on Pelikeeper but I don't want to spoil too many secrets just yet! Game development takes a lo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-21T18:42:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833334318569868","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3657320-1826362059931816","game_id":"steam-3657320","kind":"announcement","title":"Pelikeeper Demo: OUT NOW!","summary":"Hey Pelicans,Big news!The demo for Pelikeeper is available to download and play right now!(did we forget to make a Steam post about it until the Monday after? yea maybe)The demo consists of five levels (and a boss ooo) and gives you a slice of what the overall structure of the full game will be like, including building your community of animal friends and restoring a constellation to the sky!We're also planning on localizing the demo in multiple languages in the future, but it's not quite ready ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-10T01:58:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826362059931816","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3657320-1818752592125132","game_id":"steam-3657320","kind":"announcement","title":"Officially Announcing Pelikeeper!","summary":"What is Pelikeeper?Pelikeeper is a comfy tower defense and base-building strategy game about building community and restoring light to the world. You’ll grow and defend the settlement around your lighthouse, rescue lost animal neighbors, and return constellations to the cosmos.Why play it?because video games are awesome duhActual answer: Pelikeeper will be offering a new community-centric take on the tower defense genre by combining it with base-building elements, a nostalgic, dreamlike aestheti","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-11T22:31:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1818752592125132","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3657320":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:41:00Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:40:59Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3657320":"2026-10-26T10:41:00Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3657320":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:40:59Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:40:59Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:40:59Z"},"3657330":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:41:00Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:41:00Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:41:00Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3657320","app_id":3657320,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:19Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"7fac08db5b17a2af1b7e27eadbeecc18ed8705355c6943d6c2a131a21889e5c4","respo